crates/oxurack-mod-turingmachine/README.md:197:| Method                          | Hardware equivalent                | Description                                       |
crates/oxurack-mod-turingmachine/README.md-198-|---------------------------------|------------------------------------|---------------------------------------------------|
crates/oxurack-mod-turingmachine/README.md-199-| `set_write(f32)`                | WRITE knob (TL072 + CD4016)       | Probability of keeping the feedback bit. 0.0 = fully random, 1.0 = locked loop, 0.5 = coin flip. |
crates/oxurack-mod-turingmachine/README.md-200-| `modulate_write(f32)`           | CV_IN jack (R22/R23 attenuverter) | Signed offset applied to write probability. Clamped to 0.0--1.0 after application. |
crates/oxurack-mod-turingmachine/README.md-201-| `set_length(usize)`             | LENGTH rotary (ALPS-SR8V)         | Sets loop length to the nearest valid value: 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 8, 10, 12, or 16. |
crates/oxurack-mod-turingmachine/README.md-202-| `set_length_position(usize)`    | LENGTH rotary position (0--8)     | Sets the rotary switch position directly. 0 = length 2, 8 = length 16. |
crates/oxurack-mod-turingmachine/README.md:203:| `set_scale(Scale)`              | *(no hardware equivalent)*        | Replaces the main quantizer's musical scale.       |
crates/oxurack-mod-turingmachine/README.md:204:| `set_root(u8)`                  | *(no hardware equivalent)*        | Root note for quantization. 0 = C, 1 = C#, ..., 11 = B. Clamped to 0--11. |
crates/oxurack-mod-turingmachine/README.md:205:| `set_note_range(RangeInclusive<u8>)` | *(no hardware equivalent)*   | MIDI note output range. Default is `36..=84` (C2--C6). |
crates/oxurack-mod-turingmachine/README.md-206-| `set_scale_output_scale(Scale)` | Volts expander resistor network   | Independent scale for the secondary quantizer output. |
crates/oxurack-mod-turingmachine/README.md-207-| `set_scale_output_root(u8)`     | Volts expander resistor network   | Independent root note for the secondary quantizer. |
crates/oxurack-mod-turingmachine/README.md-208-| `reset()`                       | RESET jack (async reset to CD4015)| Clears the shift register, resets clock dividers, zeroes step count. |
