crates/oxurack-mod-turingmachine/README.md-257-
crates/oxurack-mod-turingmachine/README.md:258:| Hardware signal          | Hardware component             | MIDI equivalent in this crate       |
crates/oxurack-mod-turingmachine/README.md-259-|--------------------------|-------------------------------|--------------------------------------|
crates/oxurack-mod-turingmachine/README.md-260-| CV_OUT (0--5V, 8-bit DAC)| DAC0808 + TL074 output amp    | `StepOutputs::note` (quantized)      |
