crates/oxurack-mod-turingmachine/README.md-264-| WRITE knob               | TL072 comparator + CD4016     | `WriteKnob::probability` (0.0--1.0)  |
crates/oxurack-mod-turingmachine/README.md-265-| CV_IN (write mod)        | R22/R23 attenuverter          | `TuringMachine::modulate_write()`    |
crates/oxurack-mod-turingmachine/README.md-266-| RESET jack               | Async reset to CD4015         | `TuringMachine::reset()`             |
crates/oxurack-mod-turingmachine/README.md:267:| MOVE jack/button (VCV)   | Not on hardware; VCV addition | `TuringMachine::move_step()`         |
crates/oxurack-mod-turingmachine/README.md-268-| SCALE out (VCV)          | Volts expander resistor net   | `StepOutputs::scale_note`            |
crates/oxurack-mod-turingmachine/README.md-269-| PULSE1--PULSE6 (expander)| CD4081 AND gates (TuringBack) | `StepOutputs::pulses[0..5]`          |
crates/oxurack-mod-turingmachine/README.md-270-| GATE1--GATE8 (expander)  | CD4050 buffers (TuringBack)   | `StepOutputs::gates[0..7]`           |
crates/oxurack-mod-turingmachine/README.md:271:| 1/2 clock out (VCV)      | Not on hardware; VCV addition | `StepOutputs::div2`                  |
crates/oxurack-mod-turingmachine/README.md:272:| 1/4 clock out (VCV)      | Not on hardware; VCV addition | `StepOutputs::div4`                  |
